  "eng-2006-p1|The expression 'as capital is the product of human work' seems to support the argument that|rural people are poor because they lack work opportunities to fight back poverty|urban productivity is affected by mass migration from the rural areas|urban areas will continue to experience overcrowding as long as workplaces are concentrated there|rural dwellers who move to capital cities often overcome poverty": "comprehension",
